# Build output
build/
x64/
Debug/
Release/

# Visual Studio per-user state
*.vcxproj.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Prebuilt/extracted dependencies (re-fetchable)
deps/pdcurses.zip
deps/PDCurses-3.9/

# Per-developer Claude Code context. Kept local so everyone can have
# their own standing instructions without polluting the repo.
CLAUDE.md

# Local porting notes — kept out of the repo so they can stay rough.
# docs/* (not docs/) so negations below can re-include specific files.
docs/*
!docs/save_game_format.md
!docs/jsbeeb_bridge_setup.md
!docs/images/
!docs/images/**
behaviour_todos.md

# Per-developer Claude Code session state.
.claude/

# Runtime artefacts (save files, log output, scratch disassembly dumps).
*.sav
*.dec
*.log
exile-EXILE1-disassembly.txt
# Exception: extracted BBC saves under save_disks/ are reference data,
# not runtime output — keep them tracked.
!save_disks/extracted/**/*.sav
